To become epic with a specific [[class]] the character must have 21 levels for a base class, or 11 levels for a [[prestige class]]. However, the 11th level of a prestige class cannot be taken unless the character has a total of 20 levels already.

e.g. A character with 10 [[rogue]], 10 [[barbarian]] and 1 [[assassin]] level has no epic classes, but a character with 21 [[rogue]] and 1 [[assassin]] level is an [[rogue#Epic rogue|epic rogue]].

[[Harper scout]]s and [[purple dragon knight]]s are only able to attain five levels and may never become epic in the Harper scout or purple dragon knight class.

